          "logicalRowId": "p36-t0012-r2"
        },
        {
          "cellId": "p36-t0012-r2-c2",
          "row": 2,
          "column": 2,
          "rawText": "针对办公用品的\n物流仓储方案\n（8分）",
          "normalizedText": "",
          "rowspan": 1,
          "colspan": 1,
          "isMergedContinue": false,
          "sourcePage": 36,
          "sourceXmlPath": "pdf:page=36;table=12;row=2;col=2",
          "logicalRowId": "p36-t0012-r2"
        },
        {
          "cellId": "p36-t0012-r2-c3",
          "row": 2,
          "column": 3,
          "rawText": "综合考察供应商配送响应速度能力，各家供应商进行横向比\n较，有针对大客户的优惠配送方案及针对偏远地区物流配送保\n障措施。对发货时效、具体各省份到货时效进行综合评价。\n1.综合考察供应商配送响应速度能力，各家供应商进行横向比",
          "normalizedText": "",
          "rowspan": 1,
          "colspan": 1,
          "isMergedContinue": false,
          "sourcePage": 36,
          "sourceXmlPath": "pdf:page=36;table=12;row=2;col=3",
          "logicalRowId": "p36-t0012-r2"
        }
      ],
      "isScoreTable": false
